* Program with modeled gaps (dynamic calls, unresolved targets)
* These are NOT syntax errors and should yield ZERO diagnostics
PROGRAM GAPS-PROG

DEFINE DATA
  LOCAL
    1 #DYNAMIC-TARGET (A20)
    1 #NOSUCHPGM (A20) VALUE 'NONEXISTENT'
  END
END

* Dynamic call (unresolvable, but no syntax error)
CALLNAT #DYNAMIC-TARGET

* Literal target with no such object (unresolvable, but no syntax error)
CALLNAT 'NONEXISTENT'

END
